  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Coastal Ecosystem Biodiversity and Resilience in the Gulf of Aqaba Jordan (GoA-J)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This comprehensive project promises to have far-reaching benefits for both the environment and the socio-economic landscape of the region. The proposed project is intricately aligned with various national and international strategies and policies, including, but not limited to: Jordan&#x2019;s Economic Modernisation Vision Executive Program  2023 &#x2013; 2025, the Jordanian National Biodiversity Strategy and Action Plan, ASEZA&#x2019;s DRR, the Convention of Biological Diversity (CBD) and its recent Kunming-Montre</narrative>
  </description>
